### 新增课程
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "CS103",
  "name": "Java程序设计",
  "teacherName": "张老师",
  "description": "Java基础课程"
}

### 课程名称为空
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "CS102",
  "name": "",
  "teacherName": "李老师",
  "description": "参数校验测试"
}

### 重复课程代码
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "CS101",
  "name": "重复课程",
  "teacherName": "王老师",
  "description": "测试课程代码唯一约束"
}

### 查询课程详情
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1

### 查询不存在的课程
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses/999999
